.TH MYGREP 1 "September 2026" "OS Assignment" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
mygrep \- search for a string in a file
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B #include "myfilefunctions.h"
.br
.B int mygrep(const char *filename, const char *pattern);
.SH DESCRIPTION
The
.B mygrep
function searches the specified file for occurrences of the given pattern.
It returns the result of the search according to whether the pattern is found.
